WEBVTT

00:17.260 --> 00:20.210
The slick, unripe fruit...

00:20.210 --> 00:22.700
Yes, the slick...

00:25.880 --> 00:28.630
N-Narukara-san!

00:43.060 --> 00:45.300
How did this happen?

00:45.300 --> 00:48.630
The story dates back to yesterday morning.

00:49.070 --> 00:51.860
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

01:00.410 --> 01:05.250
These fifteen secrets in my head are written in letters, tucked away in my uniform.

01:05.460 --> 01:11.050
When you keep on making circles around me, in the middle of the launch of your image,

01:11.880 --> 01:16.590
you treat me kindly even with your mean look and puffed cheeks.

01:16.590 --> 01:22.270
For your first heart-throbbing, I'm sure you'll find it tremendous!

01:22.810 --> 01:25.730
Your voice will escape daringly!

01:25.730 --> 01:28.600
What you want to make your heart tingle, tell me!

01:28.600 --> 01:31.520
Quick! Let me! Where do you want what?! Seriously, you're terrible!

01:31.520 --> 01:33.530
These wild ideas have all detonated!

01:33.530 --> 01:36.360
I want to try and swallow more

01:36.360 --> 01:39.530
I want you to pet me more

01:39.530 --> 01:42.370
What kind of flavor is your heart?

01:42.370 --> 01:45.250
Someday, I'll be sure to grasp a hold of what's real

01:45.250 --> 01:47.540
I want to embrace you more

01:47.540 --> 01:50.750
Will you secretly let me see you?

01:50.790 --> 01:53.630
I can't get enough of this dream I'm having!

01:53.630 --> 01:59.010
Be it my heart or also my body, I'll hand them over since it's you.

01:56.840 --> 02:01.600
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

01:59.680 --> 02:04.350
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

02:02.470 --> 02:07.770
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

02:19.990 --> 02:23.990
"I Won't Go Away, I Won't Let You Go"

02:26.410 --> 02:32.170
<i>Today, I'll tell Narukara-san
the truth and apologize to her.</i>

02:37.260 --> 02:39.010
What's going on here?

02:43.440 --> 02:45.930
Wh-What is this?!

02:50.060 --> 02:53.060
Come to the teacher's office for a moment.

02:55.360 --> 02:57.140
Taketo-kun,

02:57.140 --> 02:59.610
I understand that you're a
boy going through puberty.

02:59.610 --> 03:02.830
I know that you're having
a lot of different feelings,

03:02.830 --> 03:06.540
but for you to do that!

03:06.540 --> 03:09.750
I already explained. There was this rocket...

03:09.750 --> 03:12.820
Your nose was bleeding.
You still want to keep this up?

03:12.820 --> 03:15.660
Impressive, Mr. King Freak.

03:15.660 --> 03:18.470
When I fell, I hit my nose.

03:19.040 --> 03:22.600
Anyway, whose fault do you think
it is that all this happened?

03:22.600 --> 03:25.960
I just released the photos publicly.

03:25.960 --> 03:29.240
I never said anyone did anything.

03:29.240 --> 03:32.980
Don't you think your everyday behavior
has something to do with this?

03:34.440 --> 03:36.520
Is this true?

03:36.520 --> 03:38.070
I don't know.

03:38.070 --> 03:40.560
Answer me honestly, Narukara-san.

03:40.560 --> 03:43.550
What did Taketo-kun do to you?

03:46.590 --> 03:47.650
He ate it.

03:50.120 --> 03:52.660
Y-Y-Y-You ate her?

03:52.660 --> 03:55.430
That's a lie, right, Taketo?
Tell me it's a lie!

03:55.430 --> 03:57.160
How dare you...

03:57.610 --> 03:59.250
Please let go!

03:59.250 --> 04:01.840
I'm going to kill him and then myself!

04:01.840 --> 04:03.430
I'll kill myself!

04:03.430 --> 04:06.640
Calm down, Onee-sama. Not here! Not here!

04:06.640 --> 04:11.390
I don't believe it... Taketo wouldn't do that!

04:12.080 --> 04:14.630
Aki-sensei, give me some time.

04:14.630 --> 04:17.330
I'll prove his innocence.

04:19.690 --> 04:21.320
Please!

04:22.580 --> 04:24.090
Fine.

04:24.090 --> 04:28.080
Giving students a lot of latitude is part
of Inspiration Academy's motto.

04:28.080 --> 04:31.370
Once the details are clearer,
I'll determine his punishment.

04:31.370 --> 04:32.810
T-Teacher...

04:32.810 --> 04:35.580
But if you're guilty, after all...

04:45.800 --> 04:45.840
Death
Penalty

04:46.850 --> 04:48.700
Prepare yourself.

04:51.940 --> 04:54.290
This is really bad...

04:54.290 --> 04:58.940
I don't think I'm even going to
survive until the punishment.

04:58.940 --> 05:00.300
Don't worry.

05:00.300 --> 05:05.200
I won't let anyone touch you until
we discover the truth behind those photos.

05:05.200 --> 05:06.450
Ritsu...

05:07.300 --> 05:10.810
And I really dislike just
assuming a person's guilt.

05:10.810 --> 05:13.200
You want to be sure to do it right?

05:14.960 --> 05:16.710
<i>T-To do it?</i>

05:16.710 --> 05:19.000
What are you talking about?

05:19.000 --> 05:23.040
I mean, this really isn't a big deal.
Don't take it the wrong way.

05:23.040 --> 05:25.220
I just—

05:25.220 --> 05:27.970
Ritsu! The formula!

05:27.970 --> 05:30.470
3.141592...

05:31.050 --> 05:32.470
A rocket?

05:32.470 --> 05:37.200
So you were in its path? I didn't even notice.

05:37.200 --> 05:40.320
Surely, you have some kind of
video or something, right?

05:40.320 --> 05:41.480
Would you show me?

05:41.480 --> 05:43.450
No, it's a pain.

05:43.450 --> 05:45.990
I'm busy running a check
on my latest invention.

05:46.900 --> 05:48.490
Here it is!

05:49.330 --> 05:51.490
Mr. Sticky!

05:52.960 --> 05:56.500
Mr. Sticky is amazing.

06:01.250 --> 06:03.750
A pigeon-wrench!

06:01.250 --> 06:01.500
Pigeon
Wrench

06:05.010 --> 06:08.320
Its sub-unit emits special magnetic waves,

06:08.320 --> 06:11.410
which stick something to anything else.

06:16.410 --> 06:18.020
<i>Stick together...</i>

06:21.600 --> 06:22.440
Combine!

06:22.440 --> 06:22.480
A Man's Romance!

06:22.520 --> 06:23.770
A Drill Is

06:23.780 --> 06:28.780
Combine! Combine! Combine! Combine!

06:27.090 --> 06:28.780
No!

06:29.260 --> 06:30.990
<i>Docking.</i>

06:30.990 --> 06:33.280
So surprised, you can't even speak?

06:33.600 --> 06:36.250
Tell me about it another time.

06:36.250 --> 06:40.290
You still don't understand
how great Mr. Sticky really is.

06:40.290 --> 06:42.290
Okay, power up!

06:44.040 --> 06:45.170
Huh?

06:49.590 --> 06:51.510
Stay away!

07:06.320 --> 07:06.360
Smack!

07:10.670 --> 07:12.780
Ow...

07:22.280 --> 07:24.910
This really has gotten interesting.

07:26.090 --> 07:27.960
That hurts. It hurts... It really hurts!

07:29.350 --> 07:31.130
Come on...

07:31.130 --> 07:33.540
This isn't working at all!

07:33.540 --> 07:36.600
It's totally broken...

07:38.340 --> 07:39.980
Let go of Fukune-chan!

07:39.970 --> 07:41.390
You let go!

07:44.450 --> 07:46.400
What is this?

07:47.540 --> 07:49.790
Oh, right. Why not remove your clothes?

07:49.790 --> 07:51.150
I-I see.

07:51.150 --> 07:52.940
Okay, I'll do it.

07:52.940 --> 07:55.260
No!

07:55.260 --> 07:56.660
You strip, Taketo...

07:56.660 --> 07:58.580
You like it anyway, for your job.

07:58.580 --> 08:00.200
Take your clothes off!

08:00.200 --> 08:04.460
Wh-What are you saying? Taketo can't
remove his clothes in public...

08:06.460 --> 08:09.700
Stop. I'll do it.

08:14.600 --> 08:15.760
Taketo?

08:16.600 --> 08:18.700
As anticipated...

08:18.700 --> 08:22.140
The only way to solve this
is by fixing the machine.

08:22.750 --> 08:24.400
How long will repairs take?

08:24.400 --> 08:27.620
Who knows? A day? A year?

08:27.620 --> 08:29.150
No way!

08:29.150 --> 08:31.400
Seriously?

08:41.680 --> 08:43.440
Just relax.

08:43.440 --> 08:45.920
I won't interfere, no matter what happens.

08:45.920 --> 08:47.500
N-No matter what?

08:47.500 --> 08:49.170
I'm not letting anything happen!

08:49.680 --> 08:52.530
<i>I can't relax...</i>

08:53.170 --> 08:57.430
<i>C-Come to think of it, it's the first time
a girl's been in my room!</i>

09:08.200 --> 09:10.270
<i>I can't fantasize about anything!</i>

09:10.700 --> 09:12.580
Due to unforeseen events,

09:12.580 --> 09:16.440
we now present
<i>The Best of Akutagawa Taketo's Fantasies</i>.

09:18.930 --> 09:22.950
Come in...

09:22.950 --> 09:24.960
T-Teacher...

09:24.970 --> 09:25.960
Teacher!

09:26.450 --> 09:28.380
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

09:28.380 --> 09:32.310
<i>I can't be thinking about that now!</i>

09:32.310 --> 09:35.670
<i>This is my chance to apologize to Narukara-san.</i>

09:36.050 --> 09:37.590
N-N-Narukara-san...

09:37.590 --> 09:41.310
<i>Molester Train: Straight-on, Toward A Nal</i>.

09:45.100 --> 09:46.330
What is that?

09:46.330 --> 09:49.050
S-Stuff for a book about trains!

09:53.400 --> 09:54.960
<i>Oh, no.</i>

09:54.960 --> 09:56.490
<i>My room is really dangerous!</i>

09:56.490 --> 09:58.110
<i>It's a powder keg of porn.</i>

09:58.110 --> 10:01.870
"I'll send you the documents you requested."

10:03.050 --> 10:04.620
Fax spam!

10:07.660 --> 10:10.080
C-Could I clean my room?

10:10.080 --> 10:11.130
Sure.

10:11.140 --> 10:12.290
Let me go!

10:12.290 --> 10:13.980
Onee-sama, calm down...

10:13.980 --> 10:17.880
I can't leave Fukune-chan stuck
in that den of iniquity!

10:19.770 --> 10:21.850
You have a lot of research material.

10:21.850 --> 10:24.890
Y-Yeah? I don't really know.

10:24.890 --> 10:27.700
Authors are amazing.

10:27.700 --> 10:30.400
No... Th-That's not true.

10:30.720 --> 10:34.070
<i>But now, I can talk to her calmly.</i>

10:37.860 --> 10:39.070
Um...

10:40.140 --> 10:42.180
Y-You first.

10:42.660 --> 10:44.490
Could I practice?

10:44.490 --> 10:45.580
Practice?

10:45.580 --> 10:46.580
Yeah.

10:49.540 --> 10:50.500
What's that?

10:50.500 --> 10:53.250
That emblem-like thing?

10:54.340 --> 10:57.070
Is it some kind of special clarinet?

11:00.180 --> 11:04.750
I was just curious...
It's fine if you don't want to say.

11:05.210 --> 11:06.540
It was a gift...

11:07.310 --> 11:08.680
From someone important to me.

11:08.680 --> 11:10.420
S-Someone important?

11:10.800 --> 11:12.040
My dad.

11:12.040 --> 11:13.710
Your dad?

11:13.710 --> 11:16.190
I see... Your dad, huh?

11:16.190 --> 11:20.200
But practice? You really still need
to practice, even like this?

11:20.200 --> 11:23.990
You can't stop practicing the clarinet,
not even for a single day.

11:23.990 --> 11:25.370
I see...

11:26.330 --> 11:29.370
But isn't it tough, getting motivated every day?

11:29.370 --> 11:31.230
Like if you're tired...

11:32.210 --> 11:35.290
On days like that, I think you should do something

11:35.290 --> 11:38.210
to cheer up and refresh yourself.

11:39.670 --> 11:41.320
I see...

11:41.320 --> 11:43.220
So that's how it is for everyone.

11:47.640 --> 11:48.930
Hello?

11:48.930 --> 11:49.880
Hello.

11:49.880 --> 11:51.730
U-Utae-san?

12:02.630 --> 12:04.740
Sounds like this is pretty bad.

12:04.740 --> 12:07.380
Yeah, um, well...

12:07.380 --> 12:10.760
Lots of people I know are
making a big deal over it.

12:10.760 --> 12:12.260
I wonder why.

12:12.260 --> 12:15.010
You'd never do that.

12:15.750 --> 12:19.120
Utae-san, thank you!

12:19.850 --> 12:21.520
Anyway, Taketo-kun...

12:21.520 --> 12:22.600
Yes?

12:24.260 --> 12:27.530
Is someone there with you?

12:27.530 --> 12:29.190
N-Not really!

12:29.190 --> 12:33.320
Anyway, my editor's coming over!
Sorry! I'll talk to you later!

12:33.320 --> 12:35.020
But thanks for calling! Bye!

12:38.790 --> 12:41.570
<i>Why am I lying?</i>

12:47.200 --> 12:51.420
<i>Anyway, this is amazing...</i>

12:51.420 --> 12:54.960
<i>It's as if the music is seeping into my heart.</i>

13:07.690 --> 13:08.970
Was I bothering you?

13:08.970 --> 13:10.470
No.

13:17.530 --> 13:18.660
Huh?

13:26.000 --> 13:27.290
I can't do it...

13:27.290 --> 13:31.300
I-It's okay! Just think of me as
a rock or chair or something.

13:31.300 --> 13:32.090
Okay.

13:36.730 --> 13:40.000
<i>I'm a rock. I'm not here... I'm not here!</i>

13:41.430 --> 13:43.830
Taketo's having such a miserable time.

13:43.830 --> 13:47.180
Isn't there... Isn't there anything that I can do?

13:52.820 --> 13:54.900
<i>I-It's over.</i>

13:55.570 --> 13:58.520
<i>I hope she got to practice...</i>

13:59.160 --> 14:02.270
Narukara-san, I wanted to talk to you.

14:07.540 --> 14:09.130
She fell asleep, huh?

14:10.290 --> 14:12.280
It really is late.

14:12.280 --> 14:13.950
<i>Narukara-san...</i>

14:18.340 --> 14:20.850
<i>My draft! I need a new copy of my draft!</i>

14:20.850 --> 14:24.000
<i>I see nothing here but work.
And what I don't see doesn't exist!</i>

14:24.000 --> 14:25.800
<i>It doesn't count as having seen it!</i>

14:30.550 --> 14:33.440
"His breath was like a pair of bellows.

14:33.440 --> 14:38.560
It was a cry of lust,
swollen with desire and passion.

14:38.560 --> 14:41.190
Another beast was furiously rising.

14:41.640 --> 14:45.280
placeholder

14:41.640 --> 14:45.280
It was he, himself, shining with carnal desire."

14:44.010 --> 14:47.580
Desire... Lust... Beast...

14:49.330 --> 14:51.370
Carnal... Shining...

14:51.370 --> 14:56.050
I didn't see you! I didn't see you, so forgive me!

15:00.610 --> 15:04.630
Shining... Shining... Shining...

15:00.610 --> 15:03.630
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

15:09.620 --> 15:13.140
Shining... Shining... Shining...

15:13.270 --> 15:15.940
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

15:16.500 --> 15:18.360
Once again, we're changing plans,

15:18.360 --> 15:22.020
to present
<i>The Best of Akutagawa Taketo's Fantasies</i>.

15:22.020 --> 15:23.490
N-No...

15:25.110 --> 15:27.150
A night touchdown!

15:28.530 --> 15:29.950
Hut! Hut!

15:36.460 --> 15:37.870
Good morning!

15:38.260 --> 15:39.870
I completed the repairs.

15:41.560 --> 15:43.880
Get up, Narukara-san!

15:49.880 --> 15:52.060
Did you really fix it?

15:52.060 --> 15:54.140
Hey, you don't believe me?

15:54.140 --> 15:56.640
It's fine...

15:57.460 --> 15:59.890
Mr. Sticky Custom!

16:00.820 --> 16:03.070
I didn't just fix it!

16:01.670 --> 16:04.110
<i>In the end, I never did talk to her.</i>

16:04.730 --> 16:08.400
<i>I feel bad, but there's nothing I can do.</i>

16:04.730 --> 16:08.400
And its effective radius is...

16:09.790 --> 16:11.750
Just do it, already!

16:11.750 --> 16:12.490
You sure?

16:12.490 --> 16:14.490
All right, switch on!

16:48.790 --> 16:50.530
Huh?

16:59.510 --> 17:00.790
Look at that!

17:00.800 --> 17:03.790
This one isn't working, either.

17:03.790 --> 17:05.370
Taketo! Fukune-chan!

17:23.180 --> 17:25.940
This is even crazier.

17:29.460 --> 17:30.820
Narukara-san!

17:30.820 --> 17:33.070
Stop! My clarinet!

17:35.830 --> 17:37.110
Give it back...

17:43.290 --> 17:45.760
Let go, Taketo! It'll take you with it, too!

17:45.760 --> 17:48.000
Don't do it, even if you die!
If you don't die, I'll kill you!

17:54.000 --> 17:55.010
Ow!

17:59.250 --> 18:00.490
Let go!

18:00.490 --> 18:01.760
Don't let go!

18:03.770 --> 18:05.290
<i>O-Ouch...</i>

18:05.290 --> 18:06.820
<i>I can't hold on...</i>

18:13.790 --> 18:15.750
<i>It doesn't hurt! It doesn't hurt!</i>

18:15.750 --> 18:17.790
<i>I-It feels really good.</i>

18:17.790 --> 18:20.640
<i>I-It feels good, but it hurts!
It feels good, but it hurts!</i>

18:22.030 --> 18:24.540
Yay! Yay!

18:24.540 --> 18:27.040
Yay! Yay!

18:34.550 --> 18:37.220
Yay! Yay...

19:10.140 --> 19:11.850
Here you go.

19:14.470 --> 19:16.210
You saved it for me?

19:16.210 --> 19:19.970
It's really important to you, isn't it?

19:24.280 --> 19:25.970
U-Um...

19:27.490 --> 19:29.780
There's something I wanted
to talk to you about.

19:29.780 --> 19:31.070
Taketo!

19:31.700 --> 19:33.100
Are you all right, Fukune-chan?

19:33.100 --> 19:33.990
Yeah.

19:34.540 --> 19:36.860
He protected it.

19:36.860 --> 19:39.420
But what about those photos?

19:39.420 --> 19:40.990
Oh, those?

19:42.620 --> 19:45.990
Look... He was just trying to save her.

19:49.630 --> 19:51.590
I refuse to accept it!

19:51.590 --> 19:54.290
Someday, I will catch you.

19:55.380 --> 19:57.180
So I guess everything's over.

19:57.180 --> 20:00.480
No... If you'd just shown that
to everyone from the start,

20:00.480 --> 20:02.260
none of this would have happened.

20:02.260 --> 20:04.860
When I was investigating you, I got interested.

20:04.860 --> 20:07.620
You destroyed my machine with a nosebleed!

20:07.620 --> 20:09.890
That's so marvelous! So perverted!

20:10.360 --> 20:13.850
I'm not really happy about those compliments.

20:13.850 --> 20:16.110
Hey, let me dissect you?

20:18.330 --> 20:20.030
I-I'll see you later!

20:33.910 --> 20:37.670
No way... Dissect me?

20:40.060 --> 20:42.050
N-Narukara-san!

20:45.060 --> 20:46.320
U-Um...

20:46.320 --> 20:47.560
Yes?

20:47.970 --> 20:50.810
What did you want to talk to me about?

20:51.950 --> 20:54.260
A-A lot of things.

20:54.260 --> 20:55.940
But about that reed...

20:55.940 --> 20:58.940
Um, I didn't mean to...

20:59.530 --> 21:01.810
I was really hungry!

21:01.810 --> 21:02.710
So...

21:02.710 --> 21:07.690
No, it's all right now. I understand.

21:07.690 --> 21:08.950
Because...

21:09.500 --> 21:14.060
Back there, you were so serious.
You wouldn't have eaten it.

21:15.490 --> 21:18.260
I was wrong. I'm sorry.

21:18.260 --> 21:19.590
I-It's fine.

21:31.150 --> 21:33.100
H-Huh?

21:54.090 --> 21:58.880
<i>I see. Narukara-san is always practicing here.</i>

22:13.190 --> 22:15.850
<i>It feels so good...</i>

22:16.570 --> 22:20.350
<i>Like it's warming my heart.</i>

22:33.820 --> 22:36.730
Hey there, that FLASHY POWER needs more energy!

22:36.730 --> 22:39.770
Shout HURRAY, and raise the words of PEACE to the sky!

22:51.300 --> 22:54.220
Come, be HAPPY first thing in the morning; love KNOWS the outcome of the underwear battle!

22:54.220 --> 22:57.020
Hold on! Keep this a secret, it feels awfully squishy down below; it feels amazing.

22:57.020 --> 22:58.460
Since you're taking a peek, darling,

22:58.460 --> 22:59.870
shall I give you myself, you virgin!

22:59.870 --> 23:02.380
Oh my, you WARNING me about your arousal? I'm OKAY with that!

23:02.380 --> 23:07.950
Let's jump into the heaven that is a sparkling room!

23:07.950 --> 23:10.610
SAY EVERYBODY, we can reply to our pleasant feelings.

23:10.610 --> 23:13.070
It's time to run and PLAY BALL!

23:13.070 --> 23:15.990
Let's go! Long live PEACE! Don't give up PEACE!

23:15.990 --> 23:18.800
Today we'll surely have 'ecchi' moments,

23:18.800 --> 23:24.450
Raise your hands and JUMP! God of HIGH-TENSION, beware!

23:24.450 --> 23:27.460
Once more! Long live PEACE! Everything is all right, PEACE!

23:27.460 --> 23:30.210
Laugh and smile more, it'll always be sunny

23:30.210 --> 23:36.240
Full marks! When I'm confident with my bosoms, I'll leave you a wonderful 'ecchi' feeling!

23:36.660 --> 23:39.580
See here, SKIP that FLASHY POWER and line up!

23:39.580 --> 23:42.310
Shout HURRAY and PEACE! It's a parade, let's go!

24:02.460 --> 24:05.880
Today's Nosebleed Gauge

24:07.860 --> 24:12.470
My rocket's really cold...

